                            <Polygon POINTS="386 2429 386 2444 2153 2440 2155 2424 2151 2396 2073 2383 2071 2383 2068 2383 2042 2394 2003 2383 2001 2383 1999 2383 1997 2383 1967 2394 1650 2383 1648 2383 1546 2394 1490 2383 1488 2383 1380 2394 1269 2383 1267 2383 1265 2383 1263 2383 1239 2396 672 2385 669 2385 667 2385 626 2396 548 2385 546 2385 466 2396 405 2385 403 2385 401 2385 399 2385 383 2394 386 2429"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the spring of the year the herds are driven to the tundra, as far as the sea-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-045_l40" HPOS="386" VPOS="2457" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="48" BASELINE="386 2487 2157 2487" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="386 2487 386 2505 2157 2505 2157 2487 2157 2457 386 2457 386 2487"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="coast, in order to be freer from noxious insects, and to give them pasturage"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-045_l41" HPOS="377" VPOS="2513" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="50" BASELINE="379 2548 2155 2544" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="379 2548 379 2563 2153 2559 2155 2544 2148 2513 377 2515 379 2548"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="better suited for the summer season. Some of the camps near the head waters"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-045_l42" HPOS="381" VPOS="2565" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="383 2608 2155 2602" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="383 2608 383 2624 2153 2617 2155 2602 2151 2574 1003 2565 1001 2565 999 2565 968 2576 418 2567 416 2567 414 2567 381 2578 383 2608"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="of several rivers move to the mountains instead of to the sea, and stay near"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-045_l43" HPOS="381" VPOS="2624" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="383 2669 2155 2665" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
